  <sharedRules>
    <rule id="fbc8-8eec-6af5-2488" name="Sea Peoples (AoA2) - List Notes" publicationId="fcb9-17be-94c2-bcfc" hidden="false">
      <description>ARMIES OF ANTIQUITY v2 #122 (unofficial, Martin Gibbins). A confederacy of tribes, mainly from Anatolia, raided and invaded Cyprus, Syria, Canaan and Egypt until finally dispersing around the Mediterranean after their defeat by Rameses III of Egypt. One of the tribes, the Peleset, settled in Syria and became the Philistines. Allies And Mercenaries: The army may take allies from the Libyan list.

ARMY COMPOSITION:
[Sea Peoples]
  Characters: up to 25%
  Chariots: up to 33%
  Infantry: at least 25%
  Characters: up to 25% Chariots: up to 33% Infantry: At least 25% Allies &amp; Mercenaries: up to 25%</description>
    </rule>
  </sharedRules>
